  "body": "In the arxiv version of the paper: https://arxiv.org/pdf/2506.21734\n\nPage 4. Formula of z^i_L and z^i_H:\n\n<img width=\"1930\" height=\"526\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/60a63942-a568-4cab-bedf-2ac2feabf729\" />\n\nAccording to the code (both the codebase and the pseudo-code on the paper):\n\n```\nzL = L_net(zL, zH, x)\nzH = H_net(zH, zL)\n```\n\nIt seems that the formula should be corrected as:\n\n<img width=\"1438\" height=\"408\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11130cb0-cca2-470a-bde9-0212c833fe8f\" />\n\nI am still reading this paper, so sorry if I got it wrong.",
